This directory contains third-party RTL and a packaged Vivado IP from VERSATILE,
a partial-reconfiguration (DPR) controller:

  M. Ibrahim, S. Pillement, A. Pinna, and S. Le Nours, "VERSATILE: Very fast
  partial reconfiguration controller," ACM Transactions on Reconfigurable
  Technology and Systems, vol. 18, no. 3, Sep. 2025.

It is not covered by the pynq-pr license. Its redistribution terms are being
confirmed with the authors; until then, contact them before reusing it.
